title: "MSSA — Multichannel Singular Spectrum Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Block-Hankel embedding, Bai–Yin epsilon-rank and TLS-ESPRIT for
  oscillatory-mode extraction and signal-subspace geometry in multichannel
  time series (EEG, MEG, and other signals).
